        "literal_source_text": "Recall that the conditional density p_{y} p y p_{y} of Y_{-} Y − Y_{-} given Y_{+}=y Y + = y Y_{+}=y is p_{y}(u)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{\\|y-u\\|^{2}}{8\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,, p y ​ ( u ) ∝ exp ⁡ { − V ⁡ ( ( y + u ) / 2 ) − ‖ y − u ‖ 2 8 ​ η } , p_{y}(u)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{\\|y-u\\|^{2}}{8\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,, and define s_{y}(u)\\coloneqq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\,. s y ( u ) ≔ − 1 2 ∇ V ( ( y + u ) / 2 ) − y − u 4 ​ η . s_{y}(u)\\coloneqq-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\nabla V((y+u)/2)-\\frac{y-u}{4\\eta}\\,. Differentiating the normalized conditional density gives \\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\bigl(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\,. ∇ 𝖴 𝖯𝖯 f ( y ) = Cov ( f ( Y − ) , s y ( Y − ) | Y + = y ) . \\nabla\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f(y)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\bigl(f(Y_{-}),s_{y}(Y_{-})\\bigm|Y_{+}=y\\bigr)\\,. (C.1)"
      },
